### 2. Scrape Orchestration System
**New architecture:** Server sends structured scrape configs, extension executes multi-step flows

#### [NEW] `apps/extension/lib/scraper.ts`
```typescript
interface ScrapeConfig {
  platform: string;
  steps: ScrapeStep[];
}

interface ScrapeStep {
  action: "NAVIGATE" | "SCROLL" | "WAIT" | "EXTRACT" | "CLICK";
  selector?: string;
  value?: string;
  delay?: number;
}
```

#### [MODIFY] [apps/extension/background.ts](file:///Users/shariqqkhann/ai-coding-projects/Client%20Acquisition%20Suite/apps/extension/background.ts)
- Refactor CMD_EXECUTE to use step-based executor
- Support pagination: detect "Load More" or "Next Page"

